app ui-grid-tactics-demo-board "1.0.0"
"Player-controlled 6x6 turn-based grid-tactics skirmish: thin organism composing the std-tactics-board-2d frame + std-score — a two-marine fireteam vs two raiders. std-grid-tactics (inside the frame) is the SOLE units writer; the frame's PlayerIntent emits MOVE/ATTACK/AI_TURN intents only (never mutates units); fx-particles + round-flow + score listen. Select, move once, strike once, end turn; the enemy AI marches diagonally and mauls adjacents. Win by killing both raiders; lose when both marines fall."
;; @capabilities "grid tactics, turn-based strategy, squad skirmish, melee combat"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the PLAYER, commanding a two-marine fireteam on a 6x6 flat
;; grid — two raiders are closing from the east and only one side walks away.
;; Statuses verified 2026-07-30 by a scripted full playthrough (46/46 checks,
;; all 21 board svg assets live on the CDN — 0 404s) driving the real game on
;; the runtime-verify catalog through window.__orbitalVerification (events in,
;; canvas drawables + HUD DOM + bus event log out); results + screenshots in
;; /tmp/wave2-ui-grid-tactics-demo-board.
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a turn-based grid-tactics player expects): you act, then
;; the enemy acts. Each of your units may MOVE once and STRIKE once per turn:
;; select a marine -> green reach cells (manhattan range 3, impassable pines
;; and occupied cells excluded) -> click a lit cell -> the marine walks there
;; and STAYS selected, auto-armed (red cells = enemies in melee range 1 from
;; the NEW cell) -> click a red enemy to strike for 1 -> the marine is SPENT
;; (dimmed) until you End Turn. Raiders have 2 health, so each takes two
;; strikes. On End Turn the raider AI steps each living raider one cell
;; diagonally toward the nearest marine and mauls every adjacent marine for
;; 1. Two impassable pine trees mid-board shape the approach lanes. A kill
;; scores +10. Kill both raiders to win; lose both marines and it's a defeat.
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; PLAYER — Commander Farah: "I outmaneuver the raiders on the grid and take
;; them down before they maul my fireteam."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see the whole battlefield framed on screen —
;;      terrain under every one of the 36 cells (4 sand in the east-center),
;;      two impassable pines mid-board, my marines Rook (1,1) and Vesper (1,4)
;;      in the west, raiders Gnash (4,1) and Slash (4,4) in the east, and the
;;      HUD showing Result/Phase/Turn/Score = none/observation/0/0.
;;        WORKS — 4 units at m1(1,1) m2(1,4) e1(4,1) e2(4,4); 36 terrain
;;        tiles (4 sand); 2 ground-anchored 1x1 pines at (2,2),(3,3); HUD
;;        none/observation/0/0; every descriptor svg/flat CDN.
;;   2. Every unit is a visible sprite with a name label and a health bar I
;;      can read at a glance, idling in place — marine and raider art are
;;      visually distinct.
;;        WORKS — all units on cycling idle frames (urls differ 800ms apart),
;;        health bars frac 1.0, Rook/Vesper/Gnash/Slash labels drawn, marine
;;        vs raider base art distinct.
;;   3. I click a marine: Phase flips to selection and its reach lights green
;;      (manhattan range-3 diamond, minus the impassable pine cells and the
;;      enemy-occupied cells — those are never lit).
;;        WORKS — phase=selection; exactly the 13 expected cells lit; (2,2),
;;        (3,3) and enemy-held (4,1) not lit.
;;   4. I click a lit cell: the marine walks there (walk animation) and STAYS
;;      selected, auto-armed — Phase flips to action. A second move with the
;;      same marine in the same turn is denied, and re-selecting it lights
;;      zero green cells (one move per unit per turn).
;;        WORKS — walk anim observed; m1 (1,1)->(3,1); phase=action red=1;
;;        second TILE_CLICK left m1 at (3,1); re-select lit 0 green.
;;   5. With a marine armed (after moving, or by re-clicking the selected
;;      marine), enemies in melee range 1 glow red; I click one and strike
;;      for 1 — attack/hit animations play, a "-1" fx bursts on the target,
;;      and the striker dims to spent and cannot act again this turn.
;;        WORKS — red [(4,1)]; e1 frac 1.00->0.50; BURST "-1" on the bus +
;;        hit.svg fx painted; attack/hit anims played; striker opacity 0.45,
;;        re-click a dead guard (observation).
;;   6. Raiders have 2 health: my first strike halves the health bar, the
;;      second kills — the raider renders its death frame and Score ticks
;;      +10.
;;        WORKS — two strikes per raider; Score 0->10->20 across the two
;;        kills; both corpses rendered the death frame.
;;   7. Cancel clears my selection and every highlight, back to observation.
;;        WORKS — CANCEL -> phase=observation, 0 green 0 red.
;;   8. End Turn bumps Turn and hands over: AI_TURN fires on the bus, each
;;      living raider steps one cell diagonally toward the nearest marine,
;;      and any marine standing adjacent to a raider is mauled for 1. My
;;      spent marines are fresh again next turn.
;;        WORKS — AI_TURN on the bus, Turn 0->1; adjacent raiders mauled both
;;        marines 3->2; next-turn select of a spent marine -> selection.
;;   9. When both raiders are dead, Result flips to victory, GAME_END fires,
;;      and the board freezes — post-game clicks are dead.
;;        WORKS — victory after 2 kills; GAME_END emitted; post-game
;;        UNIT_CLICK left phase=observation, 0 green.
;;  10. If I just keep ending turns, the raiders close in and maul both
;;      marines to death — Result flips to defeat with GAME_END. Both endings
;;      are reachable.
;;        WORKS — fresh session, 5 idle End Turns -> defeat with GAME_END;
;;        raiders advanced off their spawn cells and a marine fell.
;;
;; MULTIPLAYER NOTE: GameState is [runtime, shared], so every connected
;; client watches the same skirmish; intents serialize through the server
;; authority. There is no per-seat ownership — any client can drive any
;; marine.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/, generated by
;; tools/asset-workflow svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/ground.svg full-cell flat tiles; terrain/sand.svg
;;             marks the east-center patch (4 tiles).
;;   Units     units/{marine,raider}.svg + animation frames
;;             .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1, attack-0, hit-0, death-0}.svg; the
;;             frame molecule url-rewrites name.svg -> name.<anim>-<i>.svg.
;;             player: m1 Rook marine 3hp (1,1)
;;                     m2 Vesper marine 3hp (1,4)
;;             enemy:  e1 Gnash raider 2hp (4,1)
;;                     e2 Slash raider 2hp (4,4)
;;   Features  features/tree.svg x2 impassable pines at (2,2) and (3,3)
;;             (matching tiles passable: false) — the mid-board chokepoints.
;;   Effects   effects/hit.svg (BURST "hit" fx), effects/explosion.svg
;;             (manifest-only).
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg = game-shell background + HUD panel.
;; ============================================================================

orbital GridTacticsDemoOrbital {
  uses Frame from "std/behaviors/std-tactics-board-2d"
  uses Score from "std/behaviors/std-score"

  type Asset = {
    url : asset
    atlas : asset
    sprite : string
    role : string
    category : string
    animations : [string]
    style : string
    dimension : string
    aspect : string
    name : string
    thumbnailUrl : string
  }
  type Unit = {
    id : string!
    position : { x : number!  y : number! }
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    team : string
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    unitType : string
    name : string
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type Tile = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    passable : boolean
    terrainSprite : Asset
  }
  type Fx = {
    id : string!
    type : string!
    x : number!
    z : number
    y : number
    message : string
    ttl : number!
  }
  type ValidMove = { x : number!  z : number! }
  type Feature = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    type : string
    assetUrl : Asset
    color : string
    elevation : number
  }
  type AssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }

  entity GameState [runtime, shared] {
    id : string!
    units : [Unit] = [ { id: "m1", position: { x: 1, y: 1 }, x: 1, y: 1, z: 0, team: "player", health: 3, maxHealth: 3, unitType: "marine", name: "Rook", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "m2", position: { x: 1, y: 4 }, x: 1, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 3, maxHealth: 3, unitType: "marine", name: "Vesper", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e1", position: { x: 4, y: 1 }, x: 4, y: 1, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 2, maxHealth: 2, unitType: "raider", name: "Gnash", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e2", position: { x: 4, y: 4 }, x: 4, y: 4, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 2, maxHealth: 2, unitType: "raider", name: "Slash", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
    fx : [Fx] = []
    tiles : [Tile] = [ { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true } ]
    result : string = "none"
    selectedUnitId : string = ""
    validMoves : [ValidMove] = []
    attackTargets : [ValidMove] = []
    movedIds : [string] = []
    actedIds : [string] = []
    uiPhase : string = "observation"
    turn : number = 0
    score : number = 0
    scoreBaseline : number = 0
    animCounter : number = 0
    frameName : string = "0"
    animUnitId : string = ""
    animState : string = "idle"
    animTicksLeft : number = 0
    animAttackerId : string = ""
    animAtkTicksLeft : number = 0
  }

  trait TacticsAuthority = Frame.traits.TacticsAuthority -> GameState {
    config {
      running: true
      gridWidth: 6
      gridHeight: 6
      attackDamage: 1
      units: [ { id: "m1", position: { x: 1, y: 1 }, x: 1, y: 1, z: 0, team: "player", health: 3, maxHealth: 3, unitType: "marine", name: "Rook", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "m2", position: { x: 1, y: 4 }, x: 1, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 3, maxHealth: 3, unitType: "marine", name: "Vesper", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e1", position: { x: 4, y: 1 }, x: 4, y: 1, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 2, maxHealth: 2, unitType: "raider", name: "Gnash", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e2", position: { x: 4, y: 4 }, x: 4, y: 4, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 2, maxHealth: 2, unitType: "raider", name: "Slash", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
      tiles: [ { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "sand", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true } ]
    }
  }

  trait FxDecay = Frame.traits.FxDecay -> GameState {
    config { running: true }
  }

  trait RoundLogic = Frame.traits.RoundLogic -> GameState {
    config { running: true }
  }

  trait ScoreKeeper = Score.traits.ScoreKeeper -> GameState {
    config { running: true, pointsPerKill: 10, startScore: 0, initialEnemies: 2 }
  }

  trait AnimClock = Frame.traits.AnimClock -> GameState {
    config { frames: [] }
  }

  trait Player = Frame.traits.PlayerIntent -> GameState {
    config {
      gridWidth: 6
      gridHeight: 6
      movementRange: 3
      attackRange: 1
      projection: "flat"
      showMinimap: false
      scale: 0.6
      backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      features: [ { id: "pine1", x: 2, y: 2, type: "tree", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/features/tree.svg", role: "decoration", category: "tree", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "tree", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "pine2", x: 3, y: 3, type: "tree", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/features/tree.svg", role: "decoration", category: "tree", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "tree", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
      assetManifest: { terrains: { ground: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/terrain/ground.svg", role: "tile", category: "ground", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "ground", thumbnailUrl: "" }, sand: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/terrain/sand.svg", role: "tile", category: "sand", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "sand", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, units: { marine: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" }, raider: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, features: { tree: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/features/tree.svg", role: "decoration", category: "tree", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "tree", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, effects: { hit: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/effects/hit.svg", role: "effect", category: "hit", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "hit", thumbnailUrl: "" }, explosion: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-grid-tactics-demo-board/svg/flat/effects/explosion.svg", role: "effect", category: "explosion", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "explosion", thumbnailUrl: "" } } }
    }
  }

  page "/grid-tactics-demo" as GridTacticsDemoPage -> TacticsAuthority, FxDecay, RoundLogic, ScoreKeeper, Player, AnimClock
}
